CREDITS

This project is an open reimplementation of "USBUtil v2.2 rev1.0 Ultimate"
(April 2014) written by Israel Ravelo Hernández (ISEKO), originally released
via www.scenespain.net. The on-disk formats consumed by this tool
(ul.cfg, ul.* chunk files, usbutil.dna/.dni/.ljs/.rcn) were documented by
clean-room reverse engineering of that binary; no original source code was
available or used. All credit for the original tool's design belongs to
ISEKO. Sony, PlayStation and PS2 are trademarks of Sony Interactive
Entertainment; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them and
is intended for use with legitimately owned game discs.
